	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "As7zuMVZ9IR2d-m-W",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 12, DX 12, IQ 9, HT 11, HP 12, WILL 9, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 10, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A3_qJbf0ASDu5JQ4s",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 29 (offense 21, protection 8), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "AWR9pus0MJ3G7Zvvc",
			"text": "Stench, reach C: When a troglodyte is angry or frightened, it secretes an oily, musklike chemical that nearly every form of animal life finds offensive. Any creature that inhales the stench exuded by the troglodyte in a 4-yard radius must make a successful HT roll or become nauseated for margin of failure minutes. Troglodytes are immune to this effect."
		},
		{
			"id": "AVAa-dLfVpt4WZbpf",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/troglodyte.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "AaqydITQWKlp3QHxB",
			"text": "Source template total: 13 points."
		},
